These folders were created by this tool: https://github.com/DMTF/Redfish-Mockup-Creator

- If the Redfish host is accessible directory run it like this:

```
docker run --rm --user="$(id -u):$(id -g)" -v /home/graham/src/libredfish/tests/mockups/lenovo:/mockup dmtf/redfish-mockup-creator:latest -u Egxadmin -p <pw-go-here> -r <BMC-IP-ADDRESS-GO-BRR> -S
```

- If you need ssh port forwarding, docker won't use that so you have to run it directly:

```
git clone https://github.com/DMTF/Redfish-Mockup-Creator.git
pip install --upgrade pip
pip install --no-cache-dir -r requirements.txt
ssh -fNL 8443:10.217.133.92:443 renojump
python redfishMockupCreate.py -u ADMIN -p <pw-go-here> -r 127.0.0.1:8443 -S -D ~/src/libredfish/tests/mockups/supermicro/
```

The mockup server which the integration test runs is https://github.com/DMTF/Redfish-Mockup-Server
